## [1.0.0] – 2026-01-25
### Added
- First stable release of RIAM Framework.
- RSOF (General Mode) system.
- RIAM-R (Research Mode).
- Node.js framework version.
- Documentation:
  - README
  - LICENSE (Apache 2.0)
  - NOTICE
  - SECURITY.md
  - CONTRIBUTING.md
  - CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

### Improved
- Modular mode architecture.
- Core engine stability and performance.

### Notes
- This marks the foundation of the RIAM Engine ecosystem.

---

## [0.1.0] – 2026-01-22 (Pre-release)
### Added
- Initial engine concept.
- Basic modes prototype.
- Project initialization and folder structure.

